{"3192130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BATHYSPHERE", "steam_appid": 3192130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BATHYSPHERE</i> is a <strong>horror strategy adventure</strong> set inside a cramped deep-sea submersible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist descends into the abyss in search of someone who has gone missing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn-based death game unfolds in the ocean’s depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange sonar pulses with an enemy bathysphere and use the returning signals to pinpoint their location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the one who strikes first will survive—and descend deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/da349c299c032f5630252dcf590c5723.poster.avif?t=1787670998\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/da349c299c032f5630252dcf590c5723.webm?t=1787670998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/da349c299c032f5630252dcf590c5723.mp4?t=1787670998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysterious Facilities and a Looping Timeline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What on earth happened down here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use insights gained from failure and information found within strange underwater structures to gradually expand your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything resets, but your knowledge does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/2e862b02b768a4a1f46cb8342f40902a.poster.avif?t=1787670998\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/2e862b02b768a4a1f46cb8342f40902a.webm?t=1787670998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Analog Exploration of the 1940s</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bathysphere is filled with unique analog devices and paper-based documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune radio frequencies, read through old manuals, and follow the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets long buried in time are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/ca43e0844811cff78ed106b52e85e788.poster.avif?t=1787670998\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/ca43e0844811cff78ed106b52e85e788.webm?t=1787670998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/ca43e0844811cff78ed106b52e85e788.mp4?t=1787670998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BATHYSPHERE</i> is a <strong>horror strategy adventure</strong> set inside a cramped deep-sea submersible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist descends into the abyss in search of someone who has gone missing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn-based death game unfolds in the ocean’s depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange sonar pulses with an enemy bathysphere and use the returning signals to pinpoint their location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the one who strikes first will survive—and descend deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: